# Phase 127: SKY SURVEY starts the survey. From phase 122 to 127 it shared
# an ID with TRACK WHAT IS IN FRAME and started image-only tracking
# instead, so the survey checklist 44 relies on could not run.
name    Survey: SKY SURVEY starts the survey
timeout 120

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Survey
wait   5
press  GOTO:SKY SURVEY
expect 15  [STATUS] Survey 1/
absent 3   Moving target
absent 1   Not following
press  GOTO:SKY SURVEY
wait   5
